Use SOM CNL version 1.
Use prompt version 2.
Use package catalog.
Begin resource.
Use resource name Product.
Use table products.
Use path "/products".
Field category is required str and is not unique.
Field code is required str and is unique.
Field price is required float and is not unique.
Field stock is optional int and is not unique.
Field active is optional bool and is not unique.
End resource.
Begin query.
Filter exactly on field category.
Limit query results to 100.
End query.
Use migration revision cov2000.
Use no previous migration revision.
Begin routes.
Delete a row. Return 404 if it does not exist.
List rows with an optional exact string filter, limit, and offset in id order.
Create a row. Return 409 for a unique value conflict.
Update supplied fields. Return 404 if the row does not exist.
Get a row by id. Return 404 if it does not exist.
End routes.
Begin checks.
Check CRUD, exact filtering, page bounds, missing id, and unique conflict when supported.
End checks.
End request.
